{
  "slug": "local-rag",
  "name": "Local Rag",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Local-first semantic search for your codebase and conversation history. Hybrid vector + BM25 search with cross-encoder reranking, AST-aware chunking for 6 languages, smart chunking for 30+ file types, conversation memory across sessions, code annotations, dependency graphs, and documentation gap analysis. No API keys, no cloud — runs entirely on your machine.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **3 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `mimirs` (TRIGGER when: starting a new session, exploring unfamiliar code, searching for functions/types/files, planning refactors, assessing blast radius, reviewing…), `wiki` (Generate or update a structured markdown wiki from the current codebase using mimirs semantic search)\n- **Hooks** (3): `PostToolUse`, `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `mimirs`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install local-rag@claude-community` from `TheWinci/local-rag`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "hook": 3,
    "mcp": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "TheWinci",
    "url": "https://github.com/TheWinci"
  },
